OL,3,GNEWSADog bite victim died of wound
OL,4,Acomplications
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man bitten by a dog on a footpath
OL,7,Fdied from complications of the wound to
OL,8,Fhis leg, an inquest opening has heard.
OL,10,FJames Judge, 55, died after an incident
OL,11,Fon the old train line footpath off
OL,12,FBlacker Lane in Wakefield on 15 August.
OL,14,FA post-mortem examination gave a
OL,15,Fprovisional cause of death as
OL,16,Fcomplications of a right leg wound
OL,17,Fcaused by a dog bite, Wakefield
OL,18,FCoroner's Court heard.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
