OL,3,GNEWSADog bite victim died of wound
OL,4,Acomplications
OL,5,
OL,6,FLee Ellis, 55, of Calder Grove in
OL,7,FWakefield, is charged with manslaughter
OL,8,Fand being in charge of a dog
OL,9,Fdangerously out of control causing
OL,10,Finjury resulting in death. He is due to
OL,11,Fappear at Leeds Crown Court on 16
OL,12,FSeptember.
